msgid "Running Molpro"
msgstr "运行 Molpro"

msgid ""
"On Unix systems, Molpro is accessed using the *molpro* unix command. The "
"syntax is"
msgstr "在 Unix 系统上，Molpro 通过 *molpro* Unix 命令访问。语法为"

msgid "For example, a serial Molpro calculation is started using"
msgstr "例如，一个串行 Molpro 计算通过以下方式启动"

msgid "``molpro mymolecule.inp``"
msgstr "``molpro mymolecule.inp``"

msgid ""
"and this creates an output ``mymolecule.out``. For larger calculations, it "
"may be necessary to specify how much dynamic (stack) memory molpro can "
"allocate, using the ``-m`` option:"
msgstr ""
"这将创建一个输出文件 ``mymolecule.out``\\ 。对于较大的计算，可能需要使用 ``-m`` 选项指定 Molpro "
"可以分配多少动态（堆栈）内存："

msgid "``molpro -m100 mymolecule.inp``"
msgstr "``molpro -m100 mymolecule.inp``"

msgid "General Options"
msgstr "通用选项"

msgid ""
"``--directory-backup`` Backup files are stored in a single separate "
"subdirectory, named *datafile*\\ ``.d``, with subdirectories ``01``, ``02``,"
" :math:`\\dots`. ``--directory-backup`` and ``--append-backup`` are mutually"
" exclusive, and switching one of them on will force the other to be switched"
" off. ``--no-append-backup`` ``--no-directory-backup`` can also be specified"
" with the same effect, except that they do not also imply ``--backup``."
msgstr ""
"``--directory-backup`` 备份文件存储在单个独立的子目录中，名为 *datafile*\\ ``.d``\\ ，包含子目录 "
"``01``\\ 、\\ ``02``\\ 、\\ :math:`\\dots`\\ 。\\ ``--directory-backup`` 和 "
"``--append-backup`` 是互斥的，开启其中一个将强制关闭另一个。也可以指定 ``--no-append-backup`` ``--no-"
"directory-backup`` 以达到相同的效果，只是它们不隐含 ``--backup``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"``--xml-orbdump`` If this option, which is the default, is given, more data "
"such as the basis set and the occupied orbitals are dumped to the XML file, "
"ready for interpretation by iMolpro or gmolpro. Orbitals are written "
"whenever they are created, except in a geometry optimisation or finite-"
"displacement frequency calculation. For jobs that create many orbital sets, "
"to avoid creating large files, the writing of orbitals can be switched off "
"with ``-no-xml-orbdump``, or by setting the variable ``NO_XML_ORBDUMP`` in "
"the input file."
msgstr ""
"``--xml-orbdump`` "
"如果给出此选项（默认启用），更多数据（如基组和占据轨道）将被转储到XML文件中，以便iMolpro或gmolpro进行解析。轨道在创建时即被写入，但在几何优化或有限位移频率计算中除外。对于生成多个轨道集的任务，为避免生成大文件，可通过\\"
" ``-no-xml-orbdump``\\ 选项或在输入文件中设置变量\\ ``NO_XML_ORBDUMP``\\ 来关闭轨道写入功能。"

msgid ""
"``--stdout`` Write the plain-text output to standard output instead of the "
"``.out`` file. The ``.xml`` file is unaffected. This option can be useful "
"when using an integrated development environment."
msgstr ""
"``--stdout`` 将纯文本输出写入标准输出，而非 ``.out`` 文件。\\ ``.xml`` "
"文件不受影响。在使用集成开发环境时，此选项可能有用。"

msgid ""
"``--geometry`` Use this to obtain an XML output with geometry information, "
"but without performing any electronic structure calculation (e.g. to "
"visualise the geometry). Note that it needs at least one jobstep, e.g. “hf” "
"though this jobstep will not be executed."
msgstr ""
"``--geometry`` "
"使用此选项可获取包含几何结构信息的XML输出，但不执行任何电子结构计算（例如，用于可视化几何结构）。请注意，它至少需要一个作业步骤，例如“hf”，尽管此作业步骤不会被执行。"

msgid ""
"``--no-flush6`` Don’t flush the output, this might increase performance on "
"some systems as the expense of being able to poll the output."
msgstr "``--no-flush6`` 不刷新输出，这可能会在某些系统上提高性能，但代价是无法轮询输出。"

msgid "``--nouse-logfile`` All output will be in the regular output file."
msgstr "``--nouse-logfile`` 所有输出将位于常规输出文件中。"

msgid "``--version`` Print Molpro version and exit"
msgstr "``--version`` 打印 Molpro 版本并退出"

msgid ""
"``--database`` Instead of executing Molpro, instead run one of the database "
"utility scripts as described in section `interrogation and manipulation of "
"databases <post-processing_of_output_and_databases.html#interrogation-and-"
"manipulation-of-databases>`__."
msgstr ""
"``--database`` 不执行 Molpro，而是运行数据库实用脚本，如章节 `interrogation and manipulation of"
" databases <post-processing_of_output_and_databases.html#interrogation-and-"
"manipulation-of-databases>`__ 所述。"

msgid ""
"``--sysid`` For debugging when the getinfo.sh script does not give the "
"correct sysid."
msgstr "``--sysid`` 用于调试，当 getinfo.sh 脚本未能提供正确的系统标识时。"

msgid "Options for launching Molpro"
msgstr "启动 Molpro 的选项"

msgid ""
"These options are for the ``molpro`` shell script which is used to launch "
"the ``molpro.exe`` MPI program. These options should be given on the command"
" line or in the ``MOLPRO_OPTIONS`` environment variable as both of these are"
" parsed by the shell script and used to launch ``molpro.exe``, they should "
"not be given in ``.molprorc`` or any other configuration files since these "
"are not read until after ``molpro.exe`` is launched."
msgstr ""
"这些选项用于启动 ``molpro.exe`` MPI 程序的 ``molpro`` shell 脚本。这些选项应在命令行中或在 "
"``MOLPRO_OPTIONS`` 环境变量中指定，因为这两者都由 shell 脚本解析并用于启动 ``molpro.exe``\\ ，它们不应在 "
"``.molprorc`` 或任何其他配置文件中指定，因为这些文件在 ``molpro.exe`` 启动后才会被读取。"

msgid "Options for parallel execution"
msgstr "并行执行选项"

msgid ""
"The options specific to parallel execution are described `here "
"<running_molpro_on_parallel_computers.html#specifying-parallel-"
"execution>`__."
msgstr ""
"特定于并行执行的选项在 `此处 "
"<running_molpro_on_parallel_computers.html#specifyingparallelexecution>`__ "
"描述。"
